    -rw-r-----  1 root root 2602 Aug 13 05:26 sshkey.private
As we can see, the group root has read permissions, lets get rid of that.
    root@ubuntu:~$ chmod 600 sshkey.private 
    root@ubuntu:~$ ssh -i sshkey.private bandit14@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
After getting rid of the group read permissions we can log into the next level. 
